{
 "text": "So: eight characters of length, which gives the two fifty-six in the name. Then up to eighty-six characters that are either the content itself or its fingerprint, split at exactly the point where the two cost the same. Ninety-four characters at most.\n\nThe only part of this we've treated as a black box is that fingerprint. Next time, we'll open it up, and ask exactly what a hash function promises, and what it doesn't.",
